Players explore a mysterious island filled with interactive environments, books, and clues that reveal its story. The gameplay focuses on solving logic-based puzzles and uncovering the fate of two trapped brothers. It features pre-rendered visuals and a non-linear structure that encourages exploration and observation.

Myst became one of the best-selling PC games of its era and influenced the adventure game genre.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/myst', '["Windows Mobile", "Atari 2600", "Philips CD-i", "PlayStation 3", "Windows Phone", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "3DO Interactive Multiplayer", "Mac", "LaserActive", "Amiga", "Atari Jaguar CD", "Sega Saturn", "PlayStation", "PlayStation Portable"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 10.01, '2026-07-31 03:33:23', '2026-07-31 03:33:23');
